{'symbol': 'ICE', 'date': '2021-11-16 08:30:00', 'title': 'INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE PUBLISHES 2021 CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY REPORT', 'text': "ATLANTA & NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE, INC. (NYSE: ICE), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF DATA, TECHNOLOGY AND MARKET INFRASTRUCTURE, TODAY RELEASED THE COMPANY'S SIXTH ANNUAL CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY REPORT. THE REPORT SUMMARIZES ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) HIGHLIGHTS FROM 2020 AND PROVIDES AN UPDATE ON THE RANGE OF ICE'S ESG POLICIES AND METRICS. THIS REPORT ALSO MARKS THE FIRST TIME THAT ICE WORKED WITH A THIRD-PARTY CONSULTANT TO CONDUCT A FORMAL MATERIAL"}